libopencv_xfeatures2d.so.3.4: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory

Quando eu já não sabia mais o que fazer em relação ao erro da lib  xfeatures2d, após reinstalar 2x o opencv, rodei o comando (sudo find / -name "libopencv_core.so.3.2*") 

https://github.com/chenguang055/dip_cvqt/issues/1
sudo find / -name "xfeatures2d.so.3.2*"

para encontrar a lib, e adicionei ela manualmente ao projeto.
Ficou dessa forma no arquivo do projeto:

win32:CONFIG(release, debug|release): LIBS += -L$$PWD/../../../../../usr/local/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/release/ -lopencv_xfeatures2d
else:win32:CONFIG(debug, debug|release): LIBS += -L$$PWD/../../../../../usr/local/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/debug/ -lopencv_xfeatures2d
else:unix: LIBS += -L$$PWD/../../../../../usr/local/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/ -lopencv_xfeatures2d

INCLUDEPATH += $$PWD/../../../../../usr/local/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu
DEPENDPATH += $$PWD/../../../../../usr/local/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu
